    "q-143836": {
      "dom_id": "step-q143836",
      "name": "Question 14",
      "problem": "Find $\\text{E}[X{Y}^{2}],$ given that random variables $X$ and $Y$ have the joint probability density function\n\n$$\nf(x,y)=\\{\\begin{aligned}8xy,\\, & 0\\le x,\\,0\\le y,\\,{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}\\le 1; \\\\ 0, & \\text{otherwise}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "worked_solution": "Suppose $X$ and $Y$ are continuous random variables, and $f(x,y)$ is their joint probability density function. If $r:{R}^{2}\\to R$ is a function of two variables, then the rule of the lazy statistician states that\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[r(X,Y)]={∬}_{{R}^{2}}r(x,y)\\,f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\text{d}y.\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have\n\n$$\nr(x,y)=x{y}^{2}.\n$$\n\nNow, let's sketch the region $D=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x,\\,0\\le y,\\,{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}\\le 1\\},$ where $f(x,y)$ is nonzero.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14154787/assets/dfa15482cfa0e8fdc9e98b05a71d2b64a89b3886da44f6966fee9f1b5e096eef.png)\n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[X{Y}^{2}] & ={∬}_{{R}^{2}}x{y}^{2}\\,f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}x{y}^{2}\\,f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}x{y}^{2}\\cdot 8xy\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =8{\\int }_{0}^{1}{x}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}{y}^{3}\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =8{\\int }_{0}^{1}{x}^{2}{[\\frac{1}{4}{y}^{4}]}_{y=0}^{y=\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2{\\int }_{0}^{1}{x}^{2}{(1-{x}^{2})}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2{\\int }_{0}^{1}({x}^{2}-2{x}^{4}+{x}^{6})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2{[\\frac{1}{3}{x}^{3}-\\frac{2}{5}{x}^{5}+\\frac{1}{7}{x}^{7}]}_{x=0}^{x=1} \\\\  & =2[\\frac{1}{3}-\\frac{2}{5}+\\frac{1}{7}] \\\\  & =\\frac{16}{105}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-143836-a",
